# Security headers — app.premiselabs.co (Cloudflare Pages, tortoise-dashboard project)
# HSTS (#1003 §1): matches the API's value (tortoise/hosted_api.py) — max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains.
# No `preload` yet — soak first, per #1003 §1.
# Vite copies this public/ dir into dist/ on build; the Pages deploy serves dist/.
#
# CSP (#3525). Two trust levels live on this origin:
#
#   `/*` is the RELAXED default — the auth pages (`signup.html`, `welcome.html`,
#   `invite-accept.html`, `404.html`) still carry inline scripts, inline styles
#   and inline event handlers, which cannot be nonced. The default must be the
#   SAFE one: a failure here means a broken signup page.
#
#   The four SPA-document paths — `/`, `/team`, `/team/` (both are 200 rewrites
#   in `_redirects`) and `/index.html` — get STRICT via detach + re-add. Detach
#   removes the inherited value so the response carries the strict policy alone;
#   even if a detach silently did not apply in production, the browser intersects
#   the two policies and the SPA is still strict. No legacy page matches a strict
#   rule, so the failure direction is safe either way.
#
# Both values are asserted byte-identical to
# `functions/_shared/security-headers.ts::RELAXED_CSP` / `::STRICT_CSP` by
# `src/securityHeaders.test.js` (which also pins the four path selectors below).
# The Functions that bypass `_headers` stamp the same constants themselves.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://static.cloudflareinsights.com https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com https://us-assets.i.posthog.com https://www.googletagmanager.com https://connect.facebook.net https://challenges.cloudflare.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob: https:; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://cloudflareinsights.com https://*.supabase.co https://api.premiselabs.co https://us.i.posthog.com https://us-assets.i.posthog.com https://www.googletagmanager.com https://www.google-analytics.com https://region1.google-analytics.com https://connect.facebook.net https://www.facebook.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com; frame-src https://challenges.cloudflare.com; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; form-action 'self'

/
